tually said, sent or photographed. Where two answers disagree, or a date reads two ways, Quickler raises it for a person to settle, quoting the words it heard and when they were said, rather than quietly choosing one. A plan to fix something is kept as a note, never recorded as the answer. A record never files itself just because every question happens to have been answered: somebody says done, or it waits.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What happens if there is no phone signal on site?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"WhatsApp holds the messages and delivers them when signal returns. Twenty messages arriving at once in the wrong order after a basement or a rural site is handled as one walk, not twenty fragments. Voice notes recorded in poor conditions are transcribed with the vocabulary of your trade taught to the transcriber, so the words specific to your job come out right.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What file formats can Quickler read and produce?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"It builds your check from Word, PDF, Excel, OpenDocument, plain text or a photograph of a paper form. A scanned PDF with no text layer is read as a picture rather than rejected. During a walk it accepts text, voice notes, photos, documents and a location pin. It produces your own report template filled in as Word or PDF, plus a shareable web page, PDF, Word, Excel, CSV and bulk zip downloads, all self-serve and available any time.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Is Quickler a care records system or an eMAR?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"No. Quickler is the audit and evidence layer, not a clinical or care records system. It does not hold care plans, medication rounds, resident records or rostering, and those stay in your care planning system, which remains the single source of truth. It records that a check was done and keeps the evidence with it. It is also not job management software: no scheduling of work, no invoicing, no dispatch.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Quickler for?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Any team that inspects, audits or keeps a record away from a desk: care homes and domiciliary care, nurseries and early years, schools, colleges and university estates, fire risk assessors, cleaning and facilities firms, health and safety consultants, field-services trades and fleet operators. It is a general system, so a firm builds whatever check shape it needs and the same engine runs all of them. UK-first, and it works anywhere WhatsApp does.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How long does it take to set up?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Setup to a first live check typically takes under a week. You need a company name and the phone numbers of the people who will do the walks. If you upload the form or the finished report you already use, Quickler writes the questions from it, so most of the setup is done by the document you already have.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Where is the data stored and who can see it?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"On EU servers under a Data Processing Agreement with each customer. The customer is the controller and owns the data; Quickler is the processor. Admins see everything in the firm; the people doing the walks see only their own WhatsApp conversation and have no account. Every record carries a full edit history of who changed what and when. Quickler is registered with the Information Commissioner's Office, registration ZC124993. You can download everything yourself at any time, and on cancellation you download every record and Quickler deletes its copy.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ItemList\",\n      \"name\": \"quickler use case pages\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/what-is-quickler.html\",\n          \"name\": \"What is quickler?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/van-safety-checks.html\",\n          \"name\": \"WhatsApp Van Safety Checks\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/site-inspections.html\",\n          \"name\": \"WhatsApp Site Inspections\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 4,\n          \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/compliance-certificates.html\",\n          \"name\": \"WhatsApp Compliance Certificates\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
